{"page":20139,"part":1,"text":"用墨\n\n\n用墨\n\n凡作楷，墨欲干，然不可太燥。行草则燥润相杂，润以取妍，燥以取险。墨浓则笔滞，燥则笔枯，亦不可不知也。笔欲锋长劲而圆，长则含墨，可以运动，劲则有力，圆则妍美。予尝评世有三物，用不同而理相似：良弓引之则缓来，舍之则急往，世俗谓之揭箭；好刀按之则曲，舍之则劲直如初，世俗谓之回性；笔锋亦欲如此，若一引之后，已曲不复挺，又安能如人意耶！故长而不劲，不如弗长；劲而不圆，不如不劲，纸、笔、墨，皆书法之助也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20139,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"7174b65b13eaac1c9af81f7754edbbb347cd83e08cadcd1094f21be905197e05","textSha256":"7174b65b13eaac1c9af81f7754edbbb347cd83e08cadcd1094f21be905197e05","fileSha256":"7174b65b13eaac1c9af81f7754edbbb347cd83e08cadcd1094f21be905197e05","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20139-work-119.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书谱 · 用墨","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/kFfK8Dci4xmDsTtkMbtjRq","originalPages":[401],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"9dc507ae500dccd5be16ee509be1c76064d560956e34b58c442e586bb2883f7a","id":"local-401-0-9","page_id":401,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":9,"reviewedTextSha256":"e5ae0859f02d6cd8113b3036fc90867e5e30190b90ec28b2868d79fb3b7017b4","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":401,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T14:09:39.156Z","revision":"e5ae0859f02d6cd8113b3036fc90867e5e30190b90ec28b2868d79fb3b7017b4","textSha256":"e5ae0859f02d6cd8113b3036fc90867e5e30190b90ec28b2868d79fb3b7017b4","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":7,"sourceTextSh